<title>UK: London silver fixes easier at 472.50 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes easier at 472.50 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed easier at 472.50 cents vs 479.75 cents previously. No sign of forecast rally so far. No follow-through Wednesday to earlier fund buying.</p>
<p>GOLD - Struggling to clear $340.00. Lost out on Belgian coin sale news overnight. $339.80/$340.30, down $1.50.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - About $6.50 firmer at $414.00/$419.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $9.50 at $202.00/$206.00.</p>
</text>
